Package: system-monitor
Version: 1.3.1-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Kumar-Jy <https://github.com/Kumar-Jy>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Description: Universal Hardware and System Monitor for Linux (Xiaomi Pad 5)
 Real-time hardware telemetry and diagnostics monitor with GPU (Adreno 640),
 CPU, memory, battery charging power draw, and sensor instrumentation.
 Built with GTK4 and Libadwaita.
